DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The function eellff__ggeettaarrssyymm() retrieves the symbol table for an ar(1) ar‐
     chive, if one is available.

     Argument _e_l_f should be a descriptor for an ar(1) archive opened using
     eellff__bbeeggiinn() or eellff__mmeemmoorryy().

